                "type": "text",
                "text": "Alberto has built three AI agents:\n\n1. **Fraud Detection Agent** (offline evals, deployment next): Built for an online event ticketing platform, it reviews newly published events and organizers and recommends approve, reject, or request-info for a human admin. In offline evals on 31 cases, Claude Haiku 5.5 (chosen for deployment) reached 86% accuracy and approved 1% of fraud, versus 8% for the local 9B model. Stack: TypeScript, PostgreSQL, GCP.\n\n2. **Organizer Support Agent** (coming soon): Planned for the same ticketing platform, it will answer organizers' questions about sales, payouts and setup, pulling live data from PostgreSQL and the payments API. Stack: TypeScript, tool calling, MCP, PostgreSQL.\n\n3. **Portfolio Agent** (personal project): The assistant you're talking to now. It answers visitors' questions about Alberto's experience and projects, and is also exposed as an MCP server. Stack: TypeScript, Claude, MCP."
